SUMMARY:Fall Nature Sound Bath
DESCRIPTION:Set within the living landscape of the UC Davis Arboretum\, this outdoor sound bath invites participants into a space of deep rest\, shared stillness\, and renewal for the times. Led by Trauma-informed Somatic Practitioner Carrie Agasid\, you’ll be gently guided through an acoustic soundscape steeped in the natural elements. \nAges 14+. Open to the public. Advance registration required. Space is limited.
