SUMMARY:6th Annual 2nd Street Trunk or Treat
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the 6th Annual 2nd Street Trunk or Treat Party! \nSaturday\, October 17\n2:00 PM–4:30 PM\nSensory-Friendly Trunk or Treat: 1:30 PM–2:00 PM \nGet ready for a fun-filled Halloween celebration for the whole family! Enjoy trunk-or-treating\, bounce houses\, dancing\, face painting\, food trucks\, an indoor playspace\, and plenty of festive surprises throughout the afternoon. \nCome dressed in your favorite costume\, bring your trick-or-treat bag\, and celebrate with Mirror Image Dance Company\, SwimAmerica-Davis\, Inclusive Arts Alliance\, and Sweet Peas Davis. \nThis community event is all about bringing families together for an afternoon of costumes\, treats\, activities\, and Halloween fun. We can’t wait to celebrate with you!
